      "content": "ok i hear you on the aspirin. i don't really want to deal with the emergency room if it's just a viral thing though, it's so expensive and slow. if i just use the motrin you mentioned, is it okay to give it even more often if he's still crying and won't sleep? like can i do it every 2 or 3 hours to make sure the fever stays down? i just want him comfortable.",
